@startuml
title Odoo 19 Cafe eCommerce Workflow - With Product Accessories Module

start

:Customer visits Cafe eCommerce website;

:Browse products;

:Select main product;

:View product details;

:Product Accessories Module\nloads configured accessories;

:Validate accessories;

if (Accessory valid?) then (Yes)

    :Check accessory is active;

    :Check product is active;

    :Check website is published;

    :Check product can be sold;

    :Display valid accessories\nwith name, image and price;

    :Customer selects accessories;

    if (Required accessory?) then (Yes)
        :Required accessory remains selected;
    else (No)
        :Customer may select/deselect;
    endif

    :Add main product\nand selected accessories to cart;

else (No)

    :Hide accessory section;

    :Add main product to cart;

endif

:Review cart;

:Proceed to checkout;

:Enter customer details;

:Select delivery/payment method;

:Confirm order;

:Odoo creates Sales Order\nwith main product + accessories;

:Delivery Order created;

:Stock reservation\naccording to Odoo settings;

:Process delivery;

:Validate delivery;

:Stock quantity decreases;

:Order completed;

stop

@enduml